# jts18 Moonwalker: Player 3 isn't able to coin up properly or start

- Source URL: https://github.com/jotego/jtcores/issues/872

When playing Moonwalker the 3rd player is not able to coin up or join the the game (tested on Japan, World and US sets)
This is when the dip switches are set for 3 players and the coin chute is set to either common or individual.
While on individual coin chute with 3 players, the coin button for player 1 inserts for player 3, still player 3 start button will not work


Also when the dips are set for 2 players and the coin chute is set individual, the coin buttons are reversed in game
Coin 1 inserts for Player 2
Coin 2 inserts for Player 1

## Fetched Issue/PR Details

Title: jts18 Moonwalker: Player 3 isn't able to coin up properly or start (#872)

